          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ee, ’ntwarora amamonto, abanto b’ororeria rw’Anaki. Intwe nigo twerora ng’a n’ebimonto ebisinini mono, tore omogwekano bw’ebisase. Naboigo twarorekana ase bare.”",
          "type": "text",
